		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>~# iptables -L -n<br />Chain INPUT (policy ACCEPT)<br />target&#160; &#160; &#160;prot opt source&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;destination&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;</p><p>Chain FORWARD (policy ACCEPT)<br />target&#160; &#160; &#160;prot opt source&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;destination&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;</p><p>Chain OUTPUT (policy ACCEPT)<br />target&#160; &#160; &#160;prot opt source&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;destination</p>]]></content>
